    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Welcome to Nulandia</strong><br><i>Explore vibrant worlds, build your dreams, and immerse yourself in endless fun!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2703670/extras/98d540cee0a2ba6de9635919b2b23304.avif?t=1754701538\" width=906 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>EXCITING GAMES TO PLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robot Races</strong>: Out speed the competition in thrilling robotic sprints!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danger Drive 3000</strong>: Conquer the ultimate road challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beach Buoy Bash</strong>: A wacky beach adventure awaits!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starship Strike</strong>: Take command in epic space battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunset Surfing</strong>: Ride the waves in this breathtaking simulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balloon Frenzy</strong>: Pop as many balloons as you can before things get too hectic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garden Game: </strong>Put your gardening skills to the test trying to grow corn in a limited time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Track:</strong> Test out your cars on Race Track while racing against AI.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2703670/extras/f344f63abad2959b341a7feb2b919f8a.avif?t=1754701538\" width=1100 height=536 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>OWN AND CREATE YOUR DIGITAL LEGACY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virtual Real Estate</strong>: Buy, develop, and sell cities, spaceports, castles, mansions and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virtual Pets</strong>: Adopt adorable companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Avatars</strong>: Personalize your in-game identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digital Marketplace</strong>: Trade and sell items seamlessly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2703670/extras/142cb1b898589e7031752109e92b65ed.avif?t=1754701538\" width=1172 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>WHY NULANDIA?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Nulandia</strong>, you're not just playing\u2014you\u2019re <strong>shaping your own world</strong>. Whether you're designing mansions, racing robots, or flying through space, this is your story to write.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd28 <strong>BUILD YOUR EMPIRE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, sell, and trade properties in bustling cities and remote islands. Customize every detail\u2014from interior decor to trophy rooms filled with your hard-earned loot.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>EXPLORE A LIVING WORLD</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in solo play, Nulandia is alive with <strong>AI-powered NPCs</strong>. Interact with them to discover quests, unlock lore, and uncover hidden treasures.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>MASTER THE ARCADE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch gears and dive into fast-paced mini-games. Pilot advanced starships, compete in high-speed turtle races, fly advanced drones, and burn rubber in intense driving challenges. Win rare collectibles to flex in your trophy room.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>HUNT LEGENDARY LOOT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique items, pets, and artifacts. Rule the player-driven economy by flipping rare finds in the marketplace.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcab <strong>Your World. Your Rules. Your Legacy.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a builder, collector, explorer, or competitor, <strong>Nulandia</strong> offers an experience for everyone. Every moment you play is a step toward <strong>becoming a legend</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <i>Free to play. No pay-to-win. Just pure fun.</i><br>\ud83d\ude80 <i>Optional premium content available for faster progression and exclusive rewards.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Welcome to Nulandia</strong><br><i>Explore vibrant worlds, build your dreams, and immerse yourself in endless fun!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2703670/extras/98d540cee0a2ba6de9635919b2b23304.avif?t=1754701538\" width=906 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>EXCITING GAMES TO PLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robot Races</strong>: Out speed the competition in thrilling robotic sprints!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danger Drive 3000</strong>: Conquer the ultimate road challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beach Buoy Bash</strong>: A wacky beach adventure awaits!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starship Strike</strong>: Take command in epic space battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunset Surfing</strong>: Ride the waves in this breathtaking simulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balloon Frenzy</strong>: Pop as many balloons as you can before things get too hectic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garden Game: </strong>Put your gardening skills to the test trying to grow corn in a limited time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Track:</strong> Test out your cars on Race Track while racing against AI.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2703670/extras/f344f63abad2959b341a7feb2b919f8a.avif?t=1754701538\" width=1100 height=536 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>OWN AND CREATE YOUR DIGITAL LEGACY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virtual Real Estate</strong>: Buy, develop, and sell cities, spaceports, castles, mansions and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virtual Pets</strong>: Adopt adorable companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Avatars</strong>: Personalize your in-game identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digital Marketplace</strong>: Trade and sell items seamlessly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2703670/extras/142cb1b898589e7031752109e92b65ed.avif?t=1754701538\" width=1172 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>WHY NULANDIA?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Nulandia</strong>, you're not just playing\u2014you\u2019re <strong>shaping your own world</strong>. Whether you're designing mansions, racing robots, or flying through space, this is your story to write.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd28 <strong>BUILD YOUR EMPIRE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, sell, and trade properties in bustling cities and remote islands. Customize every detail\u2014from interior decor to trophy rooms filled with your hard-earned loot.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>EXPLORE A LIVING WORLD</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in solo play, Nulandia is alive with <strong>AI-powered NPCs</strong>. Interact with them to discover quests, unlock lore, and uncover hidden treasures.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>MASTER THE ARCADE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch gears and dive into fast-paced mini-games. Pilot advanced starships, compete in high-speed turtle races, fly advanced drones, and burn rubber in intense driving challenges. Win rare collectibles to flex in your trophy room.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>HUNT LEGENDARY LOOT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique items, pets, and artifacts. Rule the player-driven economy by flipping rare finds in the marketplace.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcab <strong>Your World. Your Rules. Your Legacy.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a builder, collector, explorer, or competitor, <strong>Nulandia</strong> offers an experience for everyone. Every moment you play is a step toward <strong>becoming a legend</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <i>Free to play. No pay-to-win. Just pure fun.</i><br>\ud83d\ude80 <i>Optional premium content available for faster progression and exclusive rewards.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Forge your legacy in a universe of endless creativity! In Nulandia, you can build a real estate empire, hunt for rare pets and loot, and master a variety of action-packed mini-games. Design your dream mansion, show off your collection in a custom trophy room, and more. Your adventure begins now.",
